# OPEN68-SK1 — Claim skeptic (fact-check)

File: openOODA/audit/open68_sk1_claims.oot
Read-only. Tip HEAD `94df67e` plus dirty LLVM emit / smoke files. Proof ELF:
`/home/jeryd/Projects/openOODA/ooda/.ooda-cache/ooda-tmp/oodac_clangc`
Result: PASS. OPEN-68 clang-link of full oodac is still residual.

## Claims

### C1 — Diff stays on LLVM emit / named smoke — PASS
Owned `git diff --stat` (implementer files only): `cli_emit.oo`, `llvm_emit.oo`, `llvm_emit_arc.oo`, `llvm_emit_binop.oo`, `llvm_emit_call.oo`, `llvm_emit_env.oo`, `llvm_emit_expr.oo`, `llvm_emit_fn.oo`, `llvm_emit_let.oo`, `llvm_emit_method.oo`, `llvm_emit_stmt.oo`. New: `oodac/llvm_fntab.oo`, `scripts/open68_clangc_smoke.oo`.
No DE1 edits under org `std/` or `cli/pkg*`. Those paths are dirty from other agents (Grok 1/2). This slice did not write them.

### C2 — Academy headers and 256-line law — PASS
`llvm_fntab.oo` 113 lines. `open68_clangc_smoke.oo` 74 lines. Both have Title, Logline, Setup, Beats. Edited emit files remain <= 256 (`llvm_emit_call.oo` 253).

### C3 — Builtin fntab is on the emit path of the proof ELF — PASS
Source: `llvm_emit.oo` concatenates `llvm_builtin_fntab()` into `fntab` (line 44) and emits declares from builtin+imports.
`strings` of `oodac_clangc` contains `sys_exec=%OoResS|process_exec=%OoResS|...`.
IR: `call %OoResS @sys_exec` three times; `grep -c 'call i64 @sys_exec'` is 0.

### C4 — No “full clang-link” / OPEN-68-closed wording — PASS
Smoke prints `full oodac clang-link residual`. Goal file says `clang -c` only. SHIPPED must keep OPEN-68 residual. This note does not close OPEN-68.

### C5 — OPEN-30 / OPEN-68 locks still exist — PASS
`scripts/open30_llvm_lock_smoke.oo` and `scripts/open68_llvm_lock.oo` are on disk. SHIPPED still names them. Substance: match stdout `ok`, two-module stdout `2`, hello via side ELF prints Hello. `ooda run` of those two scripts did not print PASSED (harness `ERRcontractrequires` / prior named-arg C emit). That is a smoke-launch defect, not a missing lock file.

### C6 — ELF path is the side rebuild — PASS
Tree `oodac/oodac` mtime 2026-08-15; lacks builtin fntab string. Proof ELF is `.ooda-cache/ooda-tmp/oodac_clangc` (rebuilt this slice, `strings` has `sys_exec=%OoResS`). Tree binaries were not overwritten.

## Verdict
PASS on the slice as written. Do not claim a linked oodac.
